WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:03.036
-All right, well...
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:06.439
...please stop,
we have a big show,

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.741
a lot of news to get to.
I'm sure you know the big story,

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:11.911
Joe Biden, our president
went to Israel this week.

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:13.479
Nothing to do with the war,

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.915
just wanted a break
from the tension in DC.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:19.352
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:21.554
But I think
this was his best week

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:22.821
as President Joe Biden.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:24.824
-This was his--
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:27.293
I think so, his finest hour.

00:00:29.361 --> 00:00:31.063
I mean, and then he gets
his ass on a plane.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.498
It can't be easy.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.666
-He's not--
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:33.799 --> 00:00:36.235
What? He's not a young man,

00:00:36.368 --> 00:00:38.504
he remembers
when the Dead Sea was alive.

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:42.142
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:47.479 --> 00:00:49.449
He told the wailing wall
to keep it down.

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:51.484
-No he's not a young man.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:54.420
But no, he went there
to give Israel an aid package.

00:00:54.553 --> 00:00:58.691
-He's like the world's grandpa.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:58.824 --> 00:01:01.961
He can't visit without slipping
a little money, you know, just--

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:05.331
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:12.371
"Get some missiles,
don't tell Grandma."

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:15.008
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.709
But then he came home,

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:18.911
he made a great speech
about Israel.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.847
At the end of it,
they caught this on camera,

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.882
somebody else, "Clear,"
and then somebody goes,

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:24.016
"That was great!"

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:28.187
Of course, the bar for great
in the Biden White House

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:31.024
is like if Hunter doesn't wander
in with a hard-on.

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:34.360
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-Just to put it in perspective.

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:38.498
-I'm just--
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:39.498 --> 00:01:40.833
(CHUCKLES) But here's the thing,

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:43.703
he wants to give all this money
to Ukraine and to Israel.

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:47.172
But we-- (CHUCKLES)
Has to come from Congress

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:51.310
-and we don't have one.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:51.443 --> 00:01:53.980
The House of Representatives,
I'm sure you've known this

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:55.214
for the last 17 days

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:57.383
remains paralyzed
from the neck up.

00:01:57.683 --> 00:02:00.385
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:00.519 --> 00:02:02.355
The Republicans
control the house.

00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:04.123
They want to elect this guy,
Jim Jordan.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:07.160
Do you know Jim Jordan?
He's from Ohio

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:10.529
with former gym teacher,
I call him Jim "Gym" Jordan.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:13.766
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:18.971
-And he's a--
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:20.105
He's what you call

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:21.941
an insurrectionist
insurrectionist,

00:02:22.074 --> 00:02:23.909
-you know, he--
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:26.044
He's not really
an indoor Republican,

00:02:26.178 --> 00:02:27.480
which is troubling
for some of them

00:02:27.613 --> 00:02:30.082
because he sends women running
to the other party.

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:31.784
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:31.917 --> 00:02:34.821
He's an election denier,
a conspiracy theorist,

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:38.157
-and a creep.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.292
Or as Matt Gates calls him,
"Dad."

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:44.430
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:02:45.297 --> 00:02:47.333
-But-- (CHUCKLES)
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:50.469
But see, the problem
with The Republicans,

00:02:50.669 --> 00:02:52.939
is they have just enough
crazy Republicans

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:54.840
to keep a sane person
from getting the job,

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.443
and just enough sane
to keep the crazy people

00:02:57.577 --> 00:02:59.178
-from getting the job.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:59.311 --> 00:03:01.480
Ironically, they have
a Mexican standoff...

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:03.516
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-...in the Republican party.

